<title>POLAND: BANK GDANSKI 96 NET RISES TO PLN 101.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BANK GDANSKI 96 NET RISES TO PLN 101.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					 12.02 vs    8.76 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   15.54 vs    6.74 loss</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 37.08 vs   37.09</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	67.70 vs   70.60</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit					101.21 vs   90.90</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  165.07 vs  173.89</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		400.93 vs  354.12</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     740.11 vs  658.59</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Gdanski SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
